# Rogue Mode's other ways out: a run abandoned from the camp, a run lost to a wipe, a run left at the camp.
# Then rogue-continue.drive in a second launch picks that run up. --only-mod=Rogue, the run's save removed first.
until title: start prompt 60
wait 3
press Z
wait 3
press Up
wait 0.5
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue$ 60
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-party 20
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-camp 20
wait 1.5
shots 1
say abandon
press Down
wait 0.4
press Down
wait 0.4
press Z
wait 0.6
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-summary 20
wait 1.5
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue$ 20
wait 1
say wipe
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-party 20
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-camp 20
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: battle 30
wait 6
hp 0 0
hp 1 0
hp 2 0
hp 3 0
repeat Z 1.5 until rogue: the \w+ is lost 90
repeat Z 1.5 until rogue: screen rogue-summary 60
wait 1.5
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue$ 20
wait 1
say continue setup
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-party 20
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-camp 20
wait 1
quit
